WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.860
it's a little something
I want to do with you in this episode, episode 9.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.400
I call it "A visit to the Middle of the Sun."

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.240
So in this picture--

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:21.900
I tried to find a picture that is close
to what it feels like to get bodhichitta.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.180
So this picture it looks a little--

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:27.600
we were saying, me and Seiji and Tim,
we were saying it's a little new agey.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.660
It looks like it was painted in Sedona, Arizona.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:35.580
It feels a little new agey&nbsp;
but let me say something.&nbsp;

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.300
If you ever get to bodhichitta

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.460
it will feel...

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.760
This picture is very close. This picture is kind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:48.120
of close. Can you can you leave&nbsp;
it up? Just just for a minute?

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:56.460
This picture is not crazy
and it's not some kind of hippie thing.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:03.960
When you reach bodhichitta, real bodhicitta,
it feels a lot like this.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:09.180
So maybe you want to make a copy of this picture.
We paid for it already.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:13.620
So you could use it at home.&nbsp;
You could keep it at home.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:16.980
You could keep a picture like that.
Maybe put it on your screensaver on your phone.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:24.780
It's pretty close to what it&nbsp;
feels like to get bodhichitta.

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:30.000
So I would like to take you on a little&nbsp;
trip just for fun, maybe five minutes.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:37.620
Let's review what it feels like to--

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:44.460
when you first achieve real bodhicitta.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:53.280
So we're not talking about estimated--
what do you call it? Partial bodhichitta.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:57.180
Or trying to feel like you have bodhichitta.
Let's talk about the real thing.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:04.500
The day that you see emptiness directly
and you experience bodhichitta directly,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.800
let's just go through it because it's good luck.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.980
And it's an atom bomb.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:17.220
If you keep working on it,&nbsp;
if you keep working on this,

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:21.960
feeling how it feels, if you&nbsp;
keep listening to this part,

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:25.020
it will help destroy the virus.

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:28.080
I believe it will help destroy the virus.
It's like a nuclear weapon.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:32.100
And the virus is like a ketchup stain.
So here we go.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:39.360
Let's just try to imagine for five minutes
what it feels like to reach bodhichitta.&nbsp;

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.100
Here we go.

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.700
Let's take ten slow breaths.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:54.420
Focus on the exhales, long exhales, don't&nbsp;
worry about the inhale, your body will breathe.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:33.840
So please imagine
that you have just seen emptiness directly.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.880
And you come out of that direct perception,

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:45.840
and you come back to what we can call normal&nbsp;
meditation, which is still not in the world.

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:51.840
You're in a deep state of meditation,
you are still on your cushion.

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:54.840
Your eyes are closed.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:06.780
Then suddenly in front of your mind comes
the image of your mother. It's your mother.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.400
A very very perfect image&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:16.980
of your mom. Living image.
It actually is your mother.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:21.360
Maybe as you best remember her.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.860
She is looking like that right now.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.500
She's gazing at you.
She's gazing into your eyes.

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:39.420
Even though it feels like she's in the front&nbsp;
part of your mind, she's looking into your eyes.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:50.940
With great love and also a sense of need.
She deeply needs help.

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:54.300
She's in trouble in a way.

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:58.740
Like she's jumping off the Titanic or something&nbsp;

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:03.960
and she's looking at you with those eyes.
She says I need you, I need help.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:23.940
And then you say to her out loud in your heart
"don't worry mom, I'll take care of you".

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:31.200
And I will be strong enough to take care of you.
You don't need to be worried.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:39.060
I will have the power to help you
and I will do it, I promise.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:52.140
And then her picture sort of fades&nbsp;
away in the front of your mind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:55.680
and suddenly there's your father's picture.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.340
And you're looking at your father.

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:11.940
And he's got that same look in his eyes.
It's kind of expectant. But also afraid.

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:17.400
So he's looking to you like,
"can you help me?"

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:23.760
Things are getting hard in life, life is hard now.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.080
Then you say, "Dad, don't worry. I'm on it!

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:32.040
I'm studying lam rim.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:33.720
I'm studying a lot about emptiness.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:42.120
And actually I know I will have the tools
to help you soon.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:45.240
So don't worry. I'm on it.
I'm taking care of it".

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.340
And please don't--&nbsp;

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.680
you don't have to be afraid.&nbsp;
You don't have to worry.

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:54.120
I know what to do and I'm doing it.

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:57.300
Everything's going to be alright, so don't worry!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:08.880
And then maybe someone else close in your life,
your wife or your husband or your children,&nbsp;

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.780
one of your children,

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:13.080
their picture comes up in the front of your mind.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:15.600
Just their face.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:25.740
And they're also looking at you like, "can you&nbsp;
help me? Things are bad, things are really bad!"

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:32.160
Things are deadly, there's no other hope.
Can you help me?

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:39.240
And you say,
I got it covered,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:42.420
I'm taking care of it.
I can.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:49.260
I will have enough power to take care of you.

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:50.880
You really don't have to worry.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.040
I know what's going on.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.120
I know your situation.

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:57.000
I know what this life is like.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:05.400
I've got it figured out
and I will be taking care of you completely.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:08.160
You don't have to worry.
You really don't have to worry.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.520
I will take care of it.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:24.180
And then that face fades away and then you can&nbsp;
start going through faces of people you know.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.980
Close people, close family.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.920
Uncles, aunts.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.320
Brothers, sisters.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:37.980
Nephews, nieces.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:48.120
One by one, you bring them up
and you comfort them.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:54.180
And you say, "truly I will take care of it.
You will have nothing to worry about".

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:02.760
And in this way we finish all the people you know.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:06.000
All the people you ever met in your life.

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:09.960
Then you start working on all the people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:14.580
that you haven't met and all&nbsp;
the people around in this world.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.160
Start with your own neighborhood.

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:26.100
Go to the city, the whole city, and you&nbsp;
know, it's not like you can cover everybody.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:29.820
But take a person here and take a person there

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:37.260
Take it to the shores of this&nbsp;
continent that you live on.

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:39.900
Cover everybody.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.620
And then go further.

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:46.620
To other continents.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:54.000
And in this way we cover all&nbsp;
the people in this world.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:58.140
Just sitting here.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:04.200
And then you can start on
the animals in this world, on the fish.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:15.180
I'm not talking about types of animals.
I'm talking about helping each individual animal.

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:20.520
Each one looks at you. Each one is expecting.

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:25.380
Each one is afraid.
Each one gets your personal guarantee.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.900
"I'm on it. I will take care of it".

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:35.100
Just imagine going through every creature,&nbsp;
tiny creatures at the bottom of the sea.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:39.180
Tiny creatures in your bloodstream.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.000
Meet each one.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:45.240
Talk to them.

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:51.540
And when you finish all the&nbsp;
living things on this world,&nbsp;

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.020
we will start on the next world.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.200
I don't know where the next world is.
I don't know if it's Alpha Centauri?

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:02.880
Maybe it's so many light-years away.

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:11.460
Go there and start doing the same meditation
for all the people in that world.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:23.100
And in this way we cover every world
in the whole universe.

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:32.640
And the karma of meeting one by one
each of seven billion human beings,

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:38.580
and trillions of other creatures on one planet,

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:44.940
and then covering as many planets&nbsp;
as there are. Countless planets.

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:48.120
Covering each being there,

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.780
that's bodhichitta.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.620
That's the direct experience of bodhichitta.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:13:04.380
So please, for this episode,
if you can just get the feeling.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:11.880
You don't have to worry about yourself.
You don't have to worry about your family

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:15.360
You really don't have to worry about your country.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:21.420
And you don't have to worry about a world which&nbsp;
is covered by a virus. There's are small things!

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:28.860
We will take care of them, by the way.
We are we are working on a bigger project.

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:35.640
We are undertaking to help an entire universe.

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.660
Countless billions of beings.

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:43.980
Countless billions of animals and other creatures.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:49.260
And we do have that capacity. You do have that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.840
capacity. I pray that you&nbsp;
reach it in this lifetime.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:55.620
I pray that you open it in this lifetime.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:59.280
Your mind has the capacity already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:09.420
to touch every living being and promise&nbsp;
them that you will take care of them.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:17.460
So the purpose of this lam rim,
the purpose of this retreat,

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.540
is kind of like to travel&nbsp;
to the middle of the sun.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.280
Think of every living being.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:28.020
Countless living beings in&nbsp;
a universe with no limit.

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:30.900
Meet them one by one.

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:32.460
Make a promise one by one.

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:39.360
That's what happens
during the first direct experience of bodhichitta.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.140
It really happens.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.540
That's what it feels like.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:46.620
If you keep imagining it,
it will help it to happen.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:47.940
Really!

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:52.080
So it's up to you if you want it to come.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.500
If you really want to be a real bodhisattva,

00:14:57.060 --> 00:15:03.060
Then practice.
Practice this visualization once or twice a day.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:09.300
Just when you have a few minutes. Just imagine.
In your imagination. okay?

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:14.340
And it will help cause it.
And you will reach bodhichitta.

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:18.420
Then something like the virus,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:24.480
for that kind of bodhisattva, the&nbsp;
virus is not a very important thing.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:27.180
It's a very very small thing.
It's a very very small thing.

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:27.840
Making money.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.120
Making a living.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.680
Feeding your family.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.660
Finding an apartment.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:37.860
These are incredibly tiny things.
There are nothing.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.880
Your mind is like--
your heart is like the middle of the sun.

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:50.100
And a few...I don't know...a few cookies or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:55.560
a few coca-colas in the middle&nbsp;
of the sun, it doesn't matter.

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:58.620
It's not an important thing.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:00.900
Go for the big thing!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.140
Everything else becomes small.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:07.080
And everything else becomes comfortable. Easy.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:09.840
That's bodhichitta.

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:24.120
Okay!
See you in the next episode.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.260
Episode 10.

